# Normalize all text files to LF line endings in the repo, regardless of
# what line ending a given editor/OS wrote on checkout. Fixes the mixed
# CRLF/LF situation found across src/ (10 of 120 .tsx files were CRLF) that
# was causing noisy diffs. Git will still check files out using the native
# line ending for whoever's working locally if core.autocrlf is set, but
# what's stored in the repo itself is consistently LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never touch line endings, never diff as text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
